  m_Name: PlantProblem
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ProblemData
  number: 2
  problemText: A plant has just sprouted from its seed. What stage comes next?
  answer: Seedling
  solutionSteps: '1) Show the plant life cycle stages appearing in order (PLANT_SEQUENCE_POPUP).
    2) Find the sprout stage, the plant that just came out of the seed. 3) Highlight
    the stage right after it (PLANT_STAGE_BOUNCE): the seedling. '
